{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261030/photo/bkn-20261030133817107-1030_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261030140359\"/><p>兩車車頭損毀，碎片散落一地。</p><p>青衣發生交通意外。今午(30日)12時51分，一輛電單車沿青康路行駛，至近長康邨對開時，與一輛駛入邨的Tesla電動車相撞。鐵騎士人仰車翻，倒地受傷，其後由到場救護車送院治理。兩車車頭損毀，碎片散落一地，警員正調查意外原因。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-30T06:25:32.956467+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":135,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-30T05:38:17+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T06:20:21.129181+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-30T06:20:21.129181+00:00","content_hash":"504f4639ec4e1b192b68e36d6a3787ff0b9a570ce139ccaa8d68aacbb7eaf265","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}